{"articleNo":"1264","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1264&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"청계천 Job Fair와 함께하는 2010 녹색일자리 박람회 참가 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.06.15","hit":"11812","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><font color=\"#333399\" size=\"3\">청계천 Job Fair와 함께하는 2010 녹색일자리 박람회</font></strong></span></p>\n<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p>\n</span>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">□ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">행사 개요</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -45.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">○ 행사명 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">: 청계천 Job Fair와 함께하는 2010 녹색일자리 박람회</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -45.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">○ 일&nbsp; 시</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"> : ‘10. 6. 19(토) 13:00~17:00</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 85.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">○ 장&nbsp; 소</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"> : 서울고용지원센터 및 주변광장(청계천 2가)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -3.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 3.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">○ 주&nbsp; 최</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">교육과학기술부(한국산업기술진흥협회),</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">녹색성장위원회,&nbsp; 노동부, 지식경제부,<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 환경부, 국토해양부, </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -45.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">&nbsp;○ 후&nbsp; 원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"> : 서울특별시, MBC, KBC, SBS, 한국생산기술연구원</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -37.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>□ 행사 구성</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -84.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 84.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">① (이공계 및 녹색기업 현장 채용) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">80개사 참여, 구직인원 미정</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -3.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 3.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">② (자격증 컨설팅) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">대기관리기술사, 소음진동기술사, 폐기물 산업처리기사, 대기환경기사,<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;수질관리사, 환경기능사 등 녹색산업 관련 분야<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">③ (녹색체험 &amp; 이벤트관) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">재활용 작품전시 및 만들기, 녹색공모전 전시, 탄소캐시백 카드발급,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;전기자동차 시승, 에너지 체험 등</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">④ (특강 및 채용설명회) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">구직자 취업역량강화를 위한 명사 특강, 우수기업 채용설명회</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -26pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 26pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">⑤ (홍보관) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">녹색산업 소개 및 홍보자료 전달, 사업성과전시 부스, 이공계인력중개센터 홍보&nbsp;<br>부스</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">⑥ (취업지원관) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">현황판, 채용공고 게시대, 이력서 작성/접수, 문서지원 부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">스</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">※ 온라인 박람회 (</span><a href=\"http://www.green-job.or.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">www.green-job.or.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -45.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">○ 기&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">:&nbsp;&nbsp; 2010. 5. 25(화) ~ 8. 18(수)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -45.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">○ 사이트맵</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -45.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">(행사안내)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"> 박람회 소개, 기업/개인 참가안내 및 신청, 찾아오시는 길</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -45.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">(채용정보)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"> 현장 채용관, 온라인 채용관</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -45.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">(부대행사)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"> 특강/세미나, 자격증 컨설팅, 직업체험/이벤트 소개</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -45.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\">(커뮤니티)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움체&quot;\"> 공지사항, Q&amp;A, Gallery)</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
